    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280112</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ちょっと
待っていてくれ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait here a moment...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280172</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あら、また戻ってきたの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, you're back here again?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280280</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>自分の家に戻ってきて、
何が悪い</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's wrong with coming
back to my own house?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280280</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんなことより、
あれ、どこやったんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Anyway, where'd
I put that thing?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280348</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれ？　ああ、あれ？
何するの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That thing? Oh, *that* thing?
What do you need it for?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280424</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いや、あの子たちに
貸してやろうと思ってな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I was just thinking of
lending it to those kids.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280508</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれなら、あなたが
そこの棚にしまってたでしょ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, you put that one
on the shelf over there.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ……そうだったか。
最近、物忘れが激しいな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahh... Yeah, that sounds right. My
memory's been pretty bad lately.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280676</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、あれだけあっても、
仕方がないと思うんだけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But I don't imagine that one's
very useful on its own.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280732</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そっちも回収にいくさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll go collect those ones, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280804</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれとか、
そっちとかって何だ……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That one, those ones...
What're they talking about?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280848</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Not sure...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280948</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それよりも、『あれ』で
ミラルドさんもわかってるのが
すごいよね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Actually, it's pretty incredible that
Mirald knew what he meant...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280992</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クルール～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281048</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これを君たちに貸そう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll lend you this.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281108</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これって契約の指輪か！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait, this is...a pact ring!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今の君たちなら、
使いこなせると思ってな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I think you'll be able
to make good use of
it, as you are now.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281260</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、これって
すごく貴重なものだって……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, isn't this
really valuable...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281352</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、確かに貴重なものだ。
ドワーフが作ったものだからな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, it's definitely valuable.
Since the dwarfs made it and all.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281440</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ドワーフって、今は
どこかにいなくなった
ヤツらだよな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The dwarfs? Aren't they those
guys who kind of just vanished?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281532</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう、だから、
彼らがいない限りは
２度と作られることはない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right. And if they're not
around, no one can make
more of the rings.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>前はダメだって
言ってたのにどうして？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why are you giving it to us now?
You said we couldn't have it before...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281712</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>誰とも知れない子どもに、
いきなりそんな貴重なものを
貸せって言われてもな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's no way I could just hand
over something like this to a couple
of kids I've never met before.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281800</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ひでー！　じゃあ、オレたち
信用されてなかったのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ouch...! So, you're saying
you didn't trust us?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281844</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>すまないな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sorry.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281936</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、その大切な指輪を
ふたりに貸してくれる
ってことは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, if you're lending
something precious to
the two of them now...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282084</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ。君たちは
これを使うに値する
実力をつけてきてる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. You're strong enough
to use them now.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282084</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これを使えば、
精霊との契約ができて、
精霊使いにもなれるぞ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you use this, you can make
a pact with the spirits and
use them in battle.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282144</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>本当に……
いいのか……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, you're...
sure it's okay?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282236</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ。だが、旅が終わったら、
しっかり返してもらうからな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. But once you're done with
your travels, you have to return it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282284</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もちろんだよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, of course!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282352</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ありがとうございます、
&lt;Klarth&gt;さん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thank you so much, &lt;Klarth&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282400</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、サンキュ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, thanks!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よし、精霊のとこ、
行こうぜ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alright, let's go
see some spirits!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282756</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>待つんだ、慌てるんじゃない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait, don't rush.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282756</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今、私が
君たちに渡した指輪は
ガーネットだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The ring I just gave you
is the Garnet Ring.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282756</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ガーネットで契約できる
精霊はイフリートだけ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>With the Garnet Ring, you can
only make a pact with Efreet.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282756</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ノームとの契約にはルビーが、
シルフとならオパールが必要だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>For a pact with Gnome, you'll need
the Ruby Ring. For a pact with
Sylph, you'll need the Opal Ring.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282860</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>つまり……それぞれの精霊に
それぞれの指輪が必要……
ってことですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In other words... Each individual spirit
requires its own individual ring, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282972</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そういうことだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, that's right.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282972</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>とりあえず、そのガーネットは
イフリートとの契約は
完了している</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That Garnet Ring already
has a pact with Efreet.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それじゃあ、イフリートは
もう召喚できるわけですね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, we can already
summon Efreet.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283116</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>他の指輪はどこにあんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, where's the other rings?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283260</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ダオス戦役の後、
指輪はそれぞれ
あるべき場所へ戻した</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>After the battle with Dhaos,
I returned the rings to
where they belonged.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283260</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>悪用されないように、
特殊な構造の錠を
かけた箱に入れてな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And to prevent their abuse,
they've been placed in boxes
with specially-made locks.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283320</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それは
どこにあるんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, where are they?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283372</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いや、それが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, that's...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283420</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>忘れたのよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You forgot.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283468</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、まぁ、な</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh, well, yeah.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283544</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>歳をとると、
物忘れが悪くなって
いやねぇ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, it can't be nice
to lose all your
memories with age...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>50</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283680</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おまえだって
私とそう変わらないだろう！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, you're hardly any
younger than I am!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283680</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……そういうことだから、
探さなくてはいけない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Well, that's how it is, so
we'll have to look for them.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283680</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>申し訳ないが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm sorry about that, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283756</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そういうことなら、
探しゃいいだけだろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, hey, we just
need to look, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>54</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283816</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>君は宝探し気分なんでしょ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You just want a treasure
hunt, don't you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283868</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>へへっ、バレた？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Haha, you got me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>56</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284100</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>その前にカギを
回収しとかないとな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, before that, we'll
need to recover the key.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>57</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284100</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>指輪を収めた宝箱に
かけた錠を開くカギだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's the only key that can open
the locks on the treasure chests
the rings are in.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>57</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284100</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;熱砂の洞窟&lt;White&gt;に埋めてあるから、
回収しに行こう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's buried in the &lt;Red&gt;Cave of Burning
Sands&lt;White&gt;, so let's go retrieve it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>57</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284100</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>契約時は私がサポートしよう。
精霊のところへ行く時は
私を必ず連れていくんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll support you when you're forming a
pact. When you're going to one of the
spirits, make sure to bring me with you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>57</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
